; A reduction that takes all a lot holds is booked with the lot's own
; number: of the 2.00 HOOL the first transaction's interpolation leaves,
; the second reduction of 1 takes the 1.00 that is left and prints so,
; under STRICT and under FIFO alike. A reduction of less keeps its own.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Fifo "FIFO"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "units from a per-unit cost"
  Assets:Stock  HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -20.00 USD

2020-01-03 * "the same on a FIFO account"
  Assets:Fifo   HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -20.00 USD

2020-01-07 * "reduce twice"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   20 USD

2020-01-08 * "reduce twice, FIFO"
  Assets:Fifo   -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Fifo   -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   20 USD
